&lt;p&gt;Crushed PET film is a common raw material in the plastics recycling industry, requiring specialized equipment and process configurations to ensure high-quality pellet output. This article explores a real-world application of PET film recycling, focusing on the machinery and workflow implemented for a customer in Jakarta, Indonesia.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
